              "Color::from_lch(lerp(a.0, b.0, t), lerp(a.1, b.1, t), interpolate_hue_weighted(a.2, a.1, b.2, b.1, t, 0.1), alpha)")
# gradient: round-trip stop colours at segment boundaries
